     "body": "<p>This script does not seem to be updated for XACML 2.0 in release 3.6.2. It was unable to recognize my Policy element until I changed the schema back to XACML 1.0. I think we do still need this script. It is easy to deploy a broken policy and render the repository unresponsive. Backing out policies for troubleshooting requires several steps, including turning off authorization.</p>\n\n<p>Looks like updating the script only involves changing a 1 to a 2 in env-server.sh or env-server.bat.</p>",
